Welcome to the livestream of the University of Toronto’s convocation ceremony to honour #UofTGrad26 graduates from the School of Graduate Studies (SGS): Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering;  

Your hard work and dedication have led you to this remarkable achievement at U of T. You are an inspiration to us all, and we can’t wait to see the great things you will accomplish next. Congratulations! 

For more information about 2026 fall convocation, visit https://www.utoronto.ca/convocation.
